Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:25:03 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 42/94] arm64: dts: qcom: add the HiBy RS6

HiBy RS6 digital audio player: SDM660, PM660/PM660L, Sharp LS050T1SX18
panel, Goodix touch, WCN3990, hm100 FPGA DAC, KXTJ2 accelerometer on the
ADSP. Based on sdm660-xiaomi-lavender-common.dtsi; board data from the
stock 1.80 device tree.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
